<title>USA: Wachovia Corp Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Wachovia Corp Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>WINSTON-SALEM, N.C. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			   $0.97		    $0.87</p>
<p> Net			 164,600		  151,300</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			   $2.78		    $2.64</p>
<p> Net			 473,800		  456,300</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Taxable net interest income in 1996 rose 5.4 pct in Q3 and 4.8 pct in nine months.</p>
<p>Q3 1996 loan loss provision was $40.7 million, up 75.7 pct.</p>
<p>Nine months 1996 loan loss provision was $102.5 million, up 39.2 pct.</p>
<p>Average interest-earning assets rose $2.895 bln, or 7.6 pct for Q3 1996 and $3.939 bln or 10.8 pct for nine months 1996.</p>
</text>
